  "body_html": "<h1>equilibriumPayoff_eq_neg_interimExpectedPayment_zero_add_integral</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem equilibriumPayoff_eq_neg_interimExpectedPayment_zero_add_integral (A : BayesianSingleItemAuction I) (henv : A.HasInterimEnvelopeFormula) (i : I) (v_i : ℝ) : A.equilibriumPayoff i v_i = -A.interimExpectedPayment i 0 + ∫ z in 0..v_i, A.interimAllocProb i z</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>HasInterimEnvelopeFormula</li>\n</ul>",
